<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>01 / 概念地基</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>步骤：可被识别、讲解与单独训练的最小单元</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E9E62' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>已实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={340} viewBox='0 0 700 340'><circle cx='350' cy='170' r='78' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='350' y='160' font-size='26' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>步骤</text><text x='350' y='190' font-size='14' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>结构化解题操作</text><rect x='30' y='20' width='250' height='62' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='155' y='56' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>可被识别</text><rect x='420' y='20' width='250' height='62' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='545' y='56' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>可被讲解</text><rect x='30' y='258' width='250' height='62' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='155' y='294' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>可单独训练</text><rect x='420' y='258' width='250' height='62' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='545' y='294' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>可跨题复用</text><line x1='180' y1='82' x2='290' y2='128' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='520' y1='82' x2='410' y2='128' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='180' y1='258' x2='290' y2='212' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='520' y1='258' x2='410' y2='212' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>为什么是步骤</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>步骤预先定义在 YAML（backend/steps.yaml），不在单题处理时随意生成新口径。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>步骤体系覆盖大题、选择题、填空题三类题型。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>“该题的某一步”是结构化步骤在具体题目中的应用，包含该题条件下的推导、计算与书写。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>单题层面的几乎所有功能都以步骤为基础实现：既组织解题过程，也组织讲解与训练。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：项目名词与教学关系定义.md §3、§8</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 8 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>